Z||000002||mrfiero||07-20-2001||03:05 PM||||I have one of these too.  I bought my first Fiero (an '88 GT) in April of 1990, so it was at least that long ago.  Actually, I think I called and asked for this brochure in 1991 or 1992 when I was in the Navy.  There was a guy with an '85 GT on base with an Archie V-8 swap.  It was the first time I had seen a V-8 Fiero up close and was interested in it.  I still am and I still don't have the $$$ for one!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
